*.bad

# Written into the workspace by .github/workflows/ci.yml, and by anyone
# reproducing that workflow locally: the teed configure output, the ccache
# directory the cache action restores, and the two binaries copied out of the
# container-private build directory for upload.
/configure.log
/.ccache/
/out/
